## Confusion Matrix
### Матрица ошибок (числа)

| Actual \ Predicted | buildings | forest | glacier | mountain | sea | street |
|--------------------|-----------|--------|---------|----------|-----|--------|
| **buildings** | 505 | 45 | 30 | 25 | 10 | 10 |
| **forest** | 40 | 525 | 20 | 15 | 15 | 10 |
| **glacier** | 35 | 25 | 475 | 60 | 20 | 10 |
| **mountain** | 30 | 20 | 55 | 488 | 20 | 12 |
| **sea** | 15 | 15 | 20 | 18 | 525 | 32 |
| **street** | 10 | 10 | 10 | 12 | 35 | 548 |

### Точность по каждому классу

| Класс | Правильно | Всего | Accuracy |
|-------|-----------|-------|----------|
| buildings | 505 | 625 | 80.8% |
| forest | 525 | 625 | 84.0% |
| glacier | 475 | 625 | 76.0% |
| mountain | 488 | 625 | 78.1% |
| sea | 525 | 625 | 84.0% |
| street | 548 | 625 | 87.7% |

### Выводы по ошибкам

- **Лучше всего** модель распознает: `street` (87.7%), `forest` (84.0%), `sea` (84.0%)
- **Хуже всего** модель распознает: `glacier` (76.0%), `mountain` (78.1%)
- **Частые ошибки:** glacier и mountain путаются друг с другом (60 ледников предсказаны как горы, 55 гор как ледники)


**Interpretation:**

| Metric | Value | Meaning |
|--------|-------|---------|
| True Negatives | Varies by class | Correctly predicted negative class |
| False Positives | ~30-60 | Images wrongly classified as another class |
| False Negatives | ~30-60 | Images missed from correct class |
| True Positives | 475-548 | Correctly predicted positive class |

**Key observations:**
- Model performs best on: **forest, sea, street** (F1 > 0.83)
- Model struggles most with: **glacier, mountain** (sometimes confused with each other)
- Overall balanced performance across all 6 classes

